// The test pack's data text (ticket 0235): a few names, a tip (its text
// and its how, 0475), a lesson's
// title and first item (0456), a chapter title, a battle note and an exit name (0324), each the English in capitals. Everything else
// in the data is missing here, so it shows in English.
// Kept on purpose: `items.iron_axe.name` is stale (its `source` is not
// today's English), so the axe shows in English too.
